   "stimulus_html": "<figure class=\"unnumbered\">\n<img src=\"exercises/media/bd43fe4f80c205b3.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n<figcaption>(credit: modification of work by Emily Burke, PhD/BioTech Primer)</figcaption>\n</figure>",
   "stem_html": "<p>The image shows DNA strands.</p>\n<p>Which statements describe the dark spheres?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1246427,
     "content_html": "The dark spheres are nucleosomes. In middle of them, you would find proteins called purines."
    },
    {
     "id": 1246426,
     "content_html": "The dark spheres are chromatins. In middle of them, you would find proteins called histones."
